# Tooltips (400 ms dwell, then a short fade): Submit lists the moves it hands in, Undo says what it takes back, the lane pill says how
# its timeline began, a ruler tick names its turn. A tooltip is not shown before the dwell has passed.
# Layout (1400x800): Versus (150,250), Standard (690,184), Play (808,712); in the game Undo (548,90), Submit (841,90), the L0 pill (47,437)
# and the ruler's T1 tick (on e2-e4 the first board's column) at about (490,141).
wait 20
click 150 250        # Versus
wait 30
click 690 184        # Standard
wait 20
click 808 712        # Play
wait 120
clicksq 0 0 e2
wait 30
clicksq 0 0 e4
wait 40
move 841 90          # Submit: the pointer arrives ...
wait 12
capture layout-tooltip-too-early   # ... and 200 ms later no tooltip yet
wait 40
capture layout-tooltip-submit
move 548 90          # Undo
wait 60
capture layout-tooltip-undo
move 47 437          # the L0 lane pill
wait 60
capture layout-tooltip-lane
move 490 141         # the ruler
wait 60
capture layout-tooltip-ruler
